# Engine build trees. `build/` is already covered by the root .gitignore, but
# `build-vulkan/` is not, and it is the one an agent is most likely to create by
# accident (build.sh --vulkan). Both are cmake output: nothing here is source.
/build/
/build-vulkan/

# The submodule checkout itself is a gitlink, not content; if a future edit ever
# turns it into a plain directory, refuse to stage several hundred MB of C++.
/sdcpp/
